{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2021 Fall AMC 10A #2</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2021 Fall AMC 12A #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Menkara has a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b84c9767d548714b9f1c08d04298f1382eb2f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> index card. If she shortens the length of one side of this card by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inch, the card would have area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> square inches. What would the area of the card be in square inches if instead she shortens the length of the other side by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inch?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/3/a93cc67156f3631e62d79ba1e353cc3d62047547.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 17 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 18 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 19 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We construct the following table:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c675a041e6c76adb56e8213ad259239344a1b750.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{c||c|c||c} &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ [-2.5ex] \\textbf{Scenario} &amp; \\textbf{Length} &amp; \\textbf{Width} &amp; \\textbf{Area} \\\\ [0.5ex] \\hline &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ [-2ex] \\text{Initial} &amp; 4 &amp; 6 &amp; 24 \\\\ \\text{Menkara shortens one side.} &amp; 3 &amp; 6 &amp; 18 \\\\ \\text{Menkara shortens other side instead.} &amp; 4 &amp; 5 &amp; 20 \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"493\" height=\"91\" />\nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/b/9fbec26145c6f6b93121c1c4616a549d6c0b54f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 20}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8I2nzPmscTc\">https://youtu.be/8I2nzPmscTc</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Simple_and_Quick.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Simple and Quick)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Q3kkg-z0CXo\">https://youtu.be/Q3kkg-z0CXo</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/158dTGn0zhI\">https://youtu.be/158dTGn0zhI</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>for AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/o98vGHAUYjM?t=100\">https://youtu.be/o98vGHAUYjM?t=100</a>\n</p><p>for AMC 12: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jY-17W6dA3c?t=101\">https://youtu.be/jY-17W6dA3c?t=101</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aMkfa8VHjB8\">https://youtu.be/aMkfa8VHjB8</a>\n</p><p>~Lucas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A\">2021 Fall AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Pro